        "ItemName": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Item.ST_Item",
          "Key": "Prison_playboy_name",
          "SourceString": "《星闻周刊》",
          "LocalizedString": "Star Weekly"
        },
        "MaxAmount": 99999999999,
        "ItemQuality": "EItemQuality::ITEM_QUALITY_ORANGE",
        "ItemCD": 0.0,
        "TimeLimit": null,
        "ItemEffectType": "EItemEffectType::NoEffect",
        "UseContext": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Item.ST_Item",
          "Key": "Prison_playboy_usedesc",
          "SourceString": "知名娱乐周刊，每个在押人员的最爱。可用于交换珍贵的物品。",
          "LocalizedString": "A famous entertainment weekly and every inmate's favorite. Can be traded for valuable items."
        },
        "Description": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Item.ST_Item",
          "Key": "Prison_playboy_desc",
          "SourceString": "一成不变的日子里，每个人都在渴望新鲜东西，无论囚笼内外皆是如此。唯一不同的是，在高墙之内，一沓印满最新消息的铜版纸会被赋予远高于其售价的价值：谁能拥有它，谁就掌握了对「自由世界」的定义权——当所有人都对外界一无所知时，只有你对时下动态了如指掌。这或许帮不上你什么，但足以让你产生一种世界还没抛弃你的错觉。",
          "LocalizedString": "In the monotony of unchanging days, everyone craves something new, whether inside or outside the cage. The only difference is that within these walls, a stack of glossy paper printed with the latest news takes on a value far beyond its cover price. Whoever has it holds the power to define the \"free world.\" When everyone else knows nothing of the outside, only you stay informed. It might not help you in any practical way, but it's enough to create the illusion that the world hasn't forgotten you yet."
        },
